{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear levels! Climb the tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this puzzle game you will have to clear different levels by using your wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk on the tiles to advance, but be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you break a tile... you will fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to step on every tile, shattering them, and finally step on the exit tile. But avoid stepping on any shattered tile, or it will break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several mechanincs will add complexity to the puzzles, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforced tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleporters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforcer tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Etc.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617630?t=1756898471","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617630?t=1756898471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617630/ea51b73216ce2e21bbc7f344c3c8131e48bc66ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756898471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617630/ea51b73216ce2e21bbc7f344c3c8131e48bc66ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756898471","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear levels! Climb the tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this puzzle game you will have to clear different levels by using your wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk on the tiles to advance, but be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you break a tile... you will fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap